<title>NEW ZEALAND: Berkshire confirms sale of Tranz Rail ADSs.</title>
<headline>Berkshire confirms sale of Tranz Rail ADSs.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tranz Rail Ltd said on Thursday that U.S. fund Berkshire confirmed it had sold 9.8 million ordinary shares in the form of ADSs at US$18 per ADS.</p>
<p>The price equated to NZ$8.52 per share.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
